# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Datasets & run artifacts — ALLOWLIST.
#
# Ignore EVERYTHING under data/ (the actual dataset corpora, downloaded raw
# data, preprocessed JSONL, train/val/test splits, per-run GEPA logs under
# data/runs/, etc.) and re-include ONLY the hand-authored INPUTS (OA schemas,
# seed prompts, dataset READMEs) and the small shipped AGGREGATES
# (data/results/ and the no-LLM intrinsic v2 dirs). Anything not explicitly
# re-included below stays ignored — so regenerated/downloaded data and runs are
# never committed by accident. Re-create them with scripts/prepare_*.py and the
# GEPA runners.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/**
# Re-include directories so git can descend to the allowed files below.
!data/**/
# Hand-authored inputs.
!data/**/schemas/**
!data/**/seed_prompt.txt
!data/*/README.md
# Small shipped aggregates (reproduce the paper's floats without a GPU re-run).
!data/results/**
!data/synra_codex/intrinsic/v2/**
!data/synra_sort/intrinsic/v2/**
